---
layout: base.njk
title: The Safeway Strike
permalink: /research/strike/
---
{# The one sentence pair here is from Thomas's CIP proposal, verbatim. #}
{% set PL = strikePlaylist %}
<article class="py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-4xl tracking-tight uppercase font-bold text-white mb-12" style="letter-spacing: 0.1em;">The Safeway Strike</h1>

    {# The recordings. Titles, order and durations: _data/strikePlaylist.json (tools/import-strike-audio.py). #}
    <div id="songs" data-player data-artist="{{ PL.artist }}" data-album="Safeway Strike 2025" data-cover="{{ PL.cover }}"
         class="strike-player mb-12 bg-[var(--color-bg-card)] border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl p-5 scroll-mt-28" style="--c: rgb(255,255,255); --glow: 0;">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
        <img src="{{ PL.cover }}" alt="Safeway Strike 2025" width="96" height="96" class="w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 rounded-lg shrink-0">
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <p data-now class="text-white font-semibold truncate">{{ PL.tracks[0].title }}</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">{{ PL.artist }}</p>
          <div class="player-controls mt-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <button type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous" class="p-2 text-gray-400 hover:text-white"><svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6 5h2v14H6zM20 5v14L9 12z"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" data-play aria-label="Play or pause" class="play w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-black">
              <svg class="icon-play w-5 h-5 ml-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M7 4v16l13-8z"/></svg>
              <svg class="icon-pause w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6 4h4v16H6zM14 4h4v16h-4z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <button type="button" data-next aria-label="Next" class="p-2 text-gray-400 hover:text-white"><svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M16 5h2v14h-2zM4 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></button>
            <span data-time class="ml-auto font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 whitespace-nowrap">0:00</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="player-bar relative mt-5 h-3 rounded-full bg-black/70 overflow-hidden">
        <canvas data-paint class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full"></canvas>
        <span data-head class="head absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-1 -ml-0.5 rounded-full" style="left: 0"></span>
        <input data-seek type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="0" aria-label="Seek" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-0 cursor-pointer">
      </div>
      <ol data-list class="relative mt-5 max-h-80 overflow-y-auto pr-1 text-sm">
        {% for t in PL.tracks %}
        <li><a href="{{ t.file }}" data-track data-title="{{ t.title }}" data-seconds="{{ t.seconds }}" class="track flex items-baseline gap-3 py-1.5 px-2 rounded text-gray-300 hover:bg-white/5">
          <span class="num w-6 text-right font-mono text-xs text-gray-600">{{ loop.index }}</span><span class="flex-1 truncate">{{ t.title }}</span><span class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-600">{{ t.seconds | mmss }}</span></a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
      <audio preload="none"></audio>
    </div>
    <style>
      .strike-player .play { background: var(--c); box-shadow: 0 0 calc(var(--glow) * 28px) var(--c); transition: background .15s linear; }
      .strike-player .icon-pause, .strike-player[data-playing] .icon-play { display: none; }
      .strike-player[data-playing] .icon-pause { display: block; }
      .strike-player .head { background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 calc(var(--glow) * 14px) var(--c); }
      .strike-player .track[aria-current] { color: #fff; background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); }
      .strike-player .track[aria-current] .num { color: var(--c); }
      .strike-player:not(.is-enhanced) .player-controls, .strike-player:not(.is-enhanced) .player-bar { display: none; }
      .strike-player ol { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #3f3f46 transparent; }
      .strike-player ol::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
      .strike-player ol::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #3f3f46; border-radius: 3px; }
    </style>
    <script type="module" src="/assets/js/strike-player.js"></script>

    <img src="/images/strike/picket-01.webp" alt="Inside the store, 2025" class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl mb-12">

    <div class="md:flex md:gap-8 md:items-start mb-12">
      <p class="md:flex-1 text-lg text-gray-300">I went on strike with my union at Safeway in 2025. I played music on the picket line where I connected with local leadership who walked with us, and used AI to make a video before the vote that went viral among workers.</p>
      <img src="/images/strike/picket-02.webp" alt="On the picket line with a speaker, 2025" class="mt-8 md:mt-0 md:w-56 shrink-0 h-auto rounded-xl">
    </div>

    <a href="/research/karl/" class="sound-interactive interactive-rainbow inline-block px-6 py-3 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-lg">KARL</a>
  </div>
</article>
